  aciklama:
  - "\xDCzerine harikulade motiflerin i\u015Flendi\u011Fi, alt\u0131n s\u0131rmal\u0131
    bir boh\xE7a var fal\u0131nda. Hanenin i\xE7inden birinin ya da hane d\u0131\u015F\u0131ndan
    yak\u0131n bir akraban\u0131n, baz\u0131 haz\u0131rl\u0131klar gerektirecek k\u0131smetli
    bir g\xFCn\xFC yakla\u015F\u0131yor {{isim}}. Hen\xFCz kimsenin tahmin bile edemedi\u011Fi,
    g\xFCn\xFC kesinle\u015Ftirilmemi\u015F ya da \"hen\xFCz kararla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F\"
    olan bu g\xFCn i\xE7in kader plan\u0131nda geri say\u0131m \xE7oktan ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F.
    \u015Eu an saatin {{saat kac yazi}} oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrsek, tatl\u0131
    tela\u015F, gurur ve sevincin bir arada olabilece\u011Fi o tarihe, 1 ayl\u0131k,
    1 g\xFCnl\xFCk ya da 1 saatlik bir sapma ile {{sayi,90,900}} g\xFCn, {{sayi,1,23}}
    saat, {{sayi,2,59}} dakika kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yleyebilirim."
